<h1>Bonfire for Publishers</h1>
<p class="publisher-deck">A community for your readers, connected to your publication. Your look and feel throughout, on infrastructure you control.</p>
<p>Give readers and your newsroom a place to gather, discuss articles and share ideas. We can help you connect it to your publication and launch it with you. Or take the open-source software and run with it.</p>
</header>
